        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Saban, Justin Vincent\n- Organizations: LSU Tigers, Louisiana State University, Oklahoma Sooners\n- Places: Tiger Stadium, Baton Rouge, Louisiana\n- Events: 2004 Sugar Bowl, 2004 BCS National Championship game\n- Topics: 2003 LSU Tigers football team\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Saban coached the 2003 LSU Tigers football team.\n- The LSU Tigers played their home games at Tiger Stadium in Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n- The LSU Tigers won the BCS National Championship, their second championship, by defeating the Oklahoma Sooners 21-14 in the 2004 Sugar Bowl.\n- Justin Vincent played college football for Louisiana State University.\n- Justin Vincent was the MVP of the 2004 BCS National Championship game.",
